  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Given integral \\(I=\\int\\left(1+\\frac{1}{x^2-1}\\right) d x\\)\n\\(\\begin{aligned}\n& =\\int d x+\\int \\frac{d x}{(x-1)(x+1)} \\\\\n& =x+\\frac{1}{2} \\int\\left(\\frac{1}{x-1}-\\frac{1}{x+1}\\right) d x=x+\\frac{1}{2} \\log \\left(\\frac{x-1}{x+1}\\right)+c\n\\end{aligned}\\)"
  }
